Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You walk into the kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,stop, and think, “Wait… why did
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I come in here?”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like the thought\Nvanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But the doorway itself may have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,helped knock it out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brain tends to organize\Nexperience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,into separate events:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,sitting at your desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,walking down the hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,entering the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving into a new space can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,act like a boundary between one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,event and the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That shift in context may make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the thought you were holding\Nharder
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,to retrieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It usually isn’t erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The cues that made it easy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to remember have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That may also explain why walking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,back to where you started
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,can suddenly bring the thought\Nback.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So when you’re standing in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,room with no clue why you’re
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,your memory may not have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brain may have turned the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,page before you finished the\Nsentence.
